# The Worbus Server image's context is the umbrella root (BuildKit reads this file
# because it sits beside server/Dockerfile; the root keeps no .dockerignore, so
# hub-docker.yml's ./hub context is unchanged). An allowlist: only what the image
# copies is sent. hub/tools/, preview/, docs/ and every *.md stay out.
*
!hub/hub.py
!hub/requirements.txt
!server/worbus_launch.py
!server/healthcheck.py
